    {
        "content": "<p>xia-chao opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14702\">PR #14702</a> from <code>xia-chao:fix/wasi-http-field-map-capacity-error</code> to <code>bytecodealliance:main</code>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>A full HeaderMap made Fields::set/delete report invalid-syntax for valid names. http's try_entry was treating MaxSizeReached as InvalidHeaderName. This PR switches to try_insert/try_append.<br>\n</p>\n</blockquote>",
