    {
        "content": "<p><span aria-label=\"speech balloon\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f4ac\" role=\"img\" title=\"speech balloon\">:speech_balloon:</span> rvolosatovs created <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14702#discussion_r4261821601\">PR review comment</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><code>try_append</code> could fail here, which could leave the map in inconsistent state and incorrectly report size</p>\n</blockquote>",
