    {
        "content": "<p><span aria-label=\"speech balloon\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f4ac\" role=\"img\" title=\"speech balloon\">:speech_balloon:</span> rvolosatovs created <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14702#discussion_r4261839268\">PR review comment</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>could we make this smaller?</p>\n</blockquote>",
        "id": 631396406,
        "sender_full_name": "Wasmtime GitHub notifications bot",
        "timestamp": 1791912501
    },
    {
        "content": "<p><span aria-label=\"speech balloon\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f4ac\" role=\"img\" title=\"speech balloon\">:speech_balloon:</span> rvolosatovs created <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14702#discussion_r4261844115\">PR review comment</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>this seems to be testing implementation details of <code>http</code> crate, instead, let's assert the actual results we expect (e.g. error with TooManyFields)</p>\n<p>I'd suggest breaking each statement line-by-line and asserting result of each operation individually without using an array</p>\n</blockquote>",
        "id": 631396407,
        "sender_full_name": "Wasmtime GitHub notifications bot",
        "timestamp": 1791912501
    },
    {
        "content": "<p><span aria-label=\"speech balloon\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f4ac\" role=\"img\" title=\"speech balloon\">:speech_balloon:</span> rvolosatovs created <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14702#discussion_r4261782990\">PR review comment</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>The <code>key</code> was already parsed here, so could we keep using the entry API if we did something like:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Rust\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">map</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">try_entry</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">key</span><span class=\"p\">).</span><span class=\"n\">map_err</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"o\">|</span><span class=\"n\">_</span><span class=\"o\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">FieldMapError</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">TooManyFields</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">?</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/hyperium/http/blob/3dd9f5e1c3c228c26e6836ee60b36129351bfd3b/src/header/map.rs#L1260-L1273\">https://github.com/hyperium/http/blob/3dd9f5e1c3c228c26e6836ee60b36129351bfd3b/src/header/map.rs#L1260-L1273</a></p>\n</blockquote>",
