        "content": "<p><span aria-label=\"thumbs up\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f44d\" role=\"img\" title=\"thumbs up\">:thumbs_up:</span> rvolosatovs submitted <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14702#pullrequestreview-5508599734\">PR review</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Thanks!</p>\n<p>There's still a little issue with <code>set</code> setting keys that already exist, but this is already an improvement and it fixes an existing issue, so I'm going to merge this.</p>\n<p>Would you like to work on a follow-up for <code>set</code> specifically?</p>\n</blockquote>",
